### is_native

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"// The native TypeScript backend (codegenTypescript, `--backend TypeScript`); false in the F# build, whose `TypeScript`\n// run_target arms are Fable's (F# text).\ninl is_native () : bool =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () => false\n        Lua = fun () => false\n        Fsharp = fun () => false\n        Python = fun () => false\n        TypeScript = fun () => true\n        Cpp = fun () => false\n        CppHost = fun () => false\n        Delphi = fun () => false\n        Cuda = fun () => false\n        Rust = fun () => false\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  // The native TypeScript backend (codegenTypescript, `--backend TypeScript`); false in the F# build, whose `TypeScript`
  // run_target arms are Fable's (F# text).
  inl is_native () : bool =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () => false
          Lua = fun () => false
          Fsharp = fun () => false
          Python = fun () => false
          TypeScript = fun () => true
          Cpp = fun () => false
          CppHost = fun () => false
          Delphi = fun () => false
          Cuda = fun () => false
          Rust = fun () => false
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```
